description.narrative:
The result framework for DPPA's strategic plan 2023-2026 is accessible here: https://dppa.un.org/sites/default/files/results_framework_2023-2026_external_0.pdf

DPPA strategic plan 2023-2026: https://dppa.un.org/sites/default/files/dppa_strategic_plan_2023-2026.pdf

DPPA Multi-Year Appeal 2023-2026: https://dppa.un.org/en/multi-year-appeal-2023-2026

Expected key results of the Danish contribution, as specified in the cover note to the Danish Peace and stabilization engagement document (PSED):
Strengthened multi-dimensional gender-sensitive analysis;
Rapid and flexible responses to provide expertise to crisis situations in both mission and non-mission settings;
Key support to SRSGs and Special Envoy;
Strengthened networks and strategic relationships among and between DPPA and multilateral actors;
Institutional learning and accountability practices informing more effective responses to prevent conflict and sustain peace.
